21.11.2026 15:15:59 [Notification] == Embalmed Eats ==
Version 1.2.1. What it found when it set itself up, and what its settings do.
✓ All 48 of its changes to the game are in place
  They are what stop preserved food rotting, feeding you and going into recipes, and what let it go on shelves, in display cases and on the ground.
✓ It can preserve 667 kinds of food (0 of them from other mods)
  The game: 667
  57 foods that normally can't go on the ground can once preserved
✓ All 4 switched-on preserving methods work
  Wax dipping: 1 Beeswax per food in the crafting grid (667 recipes)
  Resin lacquer: 1 Resin per food in the crafting grid (667 recipes)
  Formaldehyde: 0.25 L of solution per food, sealed for 48 hours
  Salt and lime cure: 1 curing salt per food, sealed for 120 hours

== What counts as food ==
It can preserve 667 kinds of food (0 of them from other mods)
  The game: 667
AlwaysPreservable: -
NeverPreservable: game:rot
  game:rot matches 1
Something can be preserved when it feeds you, goes into meals, rots or holds a meal, unless it's a liquid. NeverPreservable, AlwaysPreservable and a mod's own embalmedeatsPreservable come first.

== Preserving methods ==
Wax dipping: in the crafting grid with 1 Beeswax per food
Resin lacquer: in the crafting grid with 1 Resin per food
Formaldehyde: seal it in a barrel with 0.25 L of formaldehyde solution per food, for 48 hours
Salt and lime cure: seal it in a barrel with 1 curing salt per food, for 120 hours
1334 wax and resin recipes were made when the server started.

== Where preserved food can go ==
Shelves: on
Display cases: on
The ground: on (57 foods that normally can't go there can once preserved)
Shrinking food with no display size of its own: 0.5×

== Eating preserved food ==
From toxicity 1: queasy (loses 30% hunger, 0 poison damage, nausea 0, 0% slower)
From toxicity 2: retching (loses 50% hunger, 2 poison damage, nausea 0, 0% slower)
From toxicity 3: poisoned (loses 80% hunger, 6 poison damage, nausea 0.5, 0% slower)
From toxicity 4: severe (loses 100% hunger, 12 poison damage, nausea 1, 30% slower)
From toxicity 5: lethal (loses 100% hunger, 40 poison damage, nausea 1.1, 50% slower)
Each preserved food eaten adds 1; one point wears off every 8 in-game hours; it stops at 10.
Nobody playing right now is poisoned.

== Its changes to the game ==
Stopping rot: 11 changes
No nutrition from preserved food: 4 changes
Sickness when it's eaten: 3 changes
Keeping it out of recipes, cooking and querns: 9 changes
Names and tooltips: 2 changes
The barrel methods: 2 changes
Shelves and display cases: 3 changes
Placing it on the ground: 4 changes
